-year-old " [:a {:href "/athletes/57935"} "Adolf Lindfors"] " of Finland, who won in heavyweight Greco-Roman in 1920."] "\n\n" [:p {} "German " [:a {:href "/athletes/58341"} "Wilfried Dietrich"] " also competed in this class, placing in a tie for fourth, after competing in the 1972 freestyle competition. This was his fifth Olympics and his eighth Olympic wrestling tournament. Several other wrestlers have competed in five Olympics, but Dietrich’s eight tournaments is an absolute Olympic best."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Round Eliminated"] [:th {} "Bad Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "379"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60520"} "Anatoly Roshchin"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "39"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/57476"} "Aleksandar Tomov"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/BUL"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/BUL.png"}] "BUL"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "299"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/59778"} "Victor Dolipschi"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ROU"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ROU.png"}] "ROU"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "414"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60886"}